<title>USA: Duke Oconee 1 nuke expected on line Wed..</title>
<headline>Duke Oconee 1 nuke expected on line Wed..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Power Co's 846 megawatt (MW) Oconee 1 nuclear power unit is expected to be back on line later today, Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Wednesday in its plant status report.</p>
<p>The unit, in Seneca, S.C., has been shut since October 4 for steam pipe inspections following a fire in the adjacent unit 2.</p>
<p>Oconee 2, with an identical generating capacity, remains at full power, and the 846 MW unit 3 is expected to return to service late this month.</p>
<p>   ((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
</text>
